hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*

# Maven / Spring Boot build
HELP.md
target/
.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar
!**/src/main/**/target/
!**/src/test/**/target/

# IDEs
.idea
*.iws
*.iml
*.ipr
.apt_generated
.classpath
.factorypath
.project
.settings
.springBeans
.sts4-cache
.vscode/

# Local secrets / env (never commit)
*.local
.env
application-local.yml
application-local.properties

# Local export output (dev fallback when no training bucket configured)
var/

# Local working docs — session bookkeeping, wiki mirrors, research/planning notes.
# Confluence is the source of truth for every *-wiki.md; the session queue + handoffs are
# workflow state, not deliverables. The committed docs (README, RUNBOOK-local,
# labelling-tool-plan, the-nebuchadnezzar) stay tracked and are unaffected by these rules.
execution-plan/
handoff-archive/
HANDOFF.md
HANDOFF-*.md
*-wiki.md
*-lld-draft.md
ADMIN-gaps.md
DEPRECATION-catalog.md
INVESTOR-*.md
PLAN-*.md
RESEARCH-*.md
TUNING-operations.md

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
~$*
